:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Madam the Savannah (Enemy)]].''
'''Madam Bride''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[The Forbidden Bride (Monthly Event)|The Forbidden Bride]]. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.7 Update|Version 2.2.7]]. She is a variant of [[Sumo Cat (Special Cat)|Sumo Cat]] with a slower recharge and movement speed, but higher stats. [[True Form]] gains [[Immune to Warp]], greatly increases health, and has 100% chance to survive a lethal strike. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], she is obtainable in the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] once clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Stage 48]] in Chapter 1.

