==Trivia==
*Madam King's appearance may be a reference to the folktale "[[wikipedia:The Emperor's New Clothes|The Emperor's New Clothes]]".
*Madam the Savannah appears to be wearing one of the [https://mediaim.expedia.com/localexpert/169707/d037b7a2-e10f-4049-b800-fee1dda9c9fe.jpg costumes] from a [https://youtu.be/4ZzIhAuJN2M Japanese ''The Lion King'' musical], which is supported by her Cat Combo [[Lion King (Combo)|Lion King]].
*Madam Bride is one of the many units that were updated to have multi-hit attacks in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]].
*Madam the Savannah was among the units that were given [[Immune to Warp]] in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]].


